Error [E0119]: `@build.os` is a fact value, not a type
  --> tests/ui/fact_plane_type_position.jet:1:17
    |
  1 | fn takes(value: @build.os) {}
    |                 ^^^^^^
 Why: Facts classify values at compile time; they do not mint or select types
 Fix: Read the fact in a compile-time value position instead
